---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy policy for the AI Chat Exporter browser extension. We do not collect, store, or transmit your personal data."
  canonicalPath="/privacy.html"
  updatedText="Last Updated: June 24, 2026"
>
  <div class="legal-highlight">
    <strong>TL;DR:</strong> We do not collect, store, or transmit your personal data. The extension
    runs entirely locally on your device.
  </div>

  <div class="legal-body">
    <h2>1. Data Collection</h2>
    <p>
      <strong>AI Chat Exporter</strong> does not collect, store, or transmit any personal
      identification information (PII) or usage data to external servers.
    </p>
    <p>
      The extension functions by reading the content of the currently active web page (your chat
      session) securely within your browser for the sole purpose of formatting it into a file
      (Markdown/JSON) and saving it to your local Downloads folder.
    </p>

    <h2>2. Permissions</h2>
    <p>The extension requires the following permissions to function:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>activeTab:</strong> Allows the extension to interact with the active page when
        launched by the user to extract chat content.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Storage:</strong> Used strictly to save your local preferences (e.g., preferred
        export format, image toggles) within your browser profile. This data is kept 100% offline
        and is not synced to any servers.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Host Access (Match Patterns):</strong> Grants permission to run on specific AI chat
        platforms (including ChatGPT, Gemini, Claude, Qwen, Perplexity, DeepSeek, Meta AI, Z.ai, and
        Mistral) to read the conversation DOM and format the export.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. Third-Party Services &amp; Analytics</h2>
    <p>
      <strong>Browser Extension:</strong> The extension itself does NOT contain any third-party
      analytics, ads, tracking scripts, or telemetry beacons.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>Documentation &amp; Landing Website (ace.covai.org):</strong> Our public website uses
      privacy-friendly, zero-cookie web analytics and session recording services with strict text
      masking to understand aggregate visitor counts, referrers, and documentation navigation. No
      personal data, prompt history, or chat exports are ever captured or transmitted.
    </p>

    <h2>4. Contact</h2>
    <p>
      If you have questions or concerns, please contact us through the official browser extension
      stores.
    </p>
  </div>
</LegalLayout>
